## Company Background & History


GetYourGuide was founded in 2009 by Johannes Reck, Tao Tao, Tobias Rein, Martin Sieber, and Pascal Mathis. The idea grew out of a trip to Beijing where co-founder Johannes Reck, arriving a day early and unsure what to do, had his visit transformed once classmate Tao Tao showed him around — the spark for a platform connecting travelers with local guides. Originally a spin-off of ETH Zurich, the company moved its headquarters to Berlin in 2012 and is led today by CEO Johannes Reck and COO Tao Tao.

